@startuml
autonumber
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
title S-04 Architecture and diagrams (architect)

participant "harness\nprimary lead" as primary
participant "harness-architect" as arch
participant "MCP\nplantuml-render" as mcp
participant "docs/architecture" as docs
participant "docs/analysis + docs/ux" as inputs
participant "harness-orchestrator" as orch

primary -> arch : task: architecture description,\nADRs, diagrams, OpenAPI, contracts
arch -> inputs : read requirements, e2e use cases,\nUX screen IDs and UI spec
arch -> arch : define SCN/SVC/API IDs and\nscope/applicability
arch -> docs : architecture-<slug>.md
arch -> docs : component, per-scenario sequence,\ndata, class, and per-service swimlane .puml
arch -> mcp : check_syntax (.puml)
mcp --> arch : valid / errors
alt syntax errors
  arch -> arch : fix .puml
  arch -> mcp : check_syntax again
end
arch -> mcp : render_file -> SVG
mcp --> arch : .svg next to .puml
arch -> docs : openapi-api-*.yaml/.json
arch -> docs : contracts-*.md\nAPI, formats, errors
arch -> arch : link every diagram/spec\nin the architecture description
arch --> orch : architecture package,\nOpenAPI, contracts, decomposition for coder
@enduml
